WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.600
Let's embrace...

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:05.980
Being together like this...

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:09.900
...is something I'll never forget!

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:13.310
Forever...

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:15.830
...under this sky...

00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:18.440
...we'll walk together!

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:21.130
In this beauty...

00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:22.240
...that I'm dreaming...

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:23.290
...the world's just a...

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:24.420
...merry, merry-go-round!

00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:26.010
With more dreaming...

00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:27.080
...and more loving...

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:28.170
...my heart is a...

00:00:28.180 --> 00:00:29.390
...merry, merry-go-round!

00:00:29.390 --> 00:00:30.690
Luvly, merry-go-round!

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:33.080
Getting ready for a good morning...

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:35.760
...I say 'good morning', then I chat and run.

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:37.940
A lovely life every day...

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:40.640
...is my wish for you, my sweet heart!

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:42.740
A, B, C, D, E, F, G!

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:45.390
A lack of vitamins isn't healthy.

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:47.520
1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7!

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:50.600
Bring along your favorite and let's go!

00:00:53.080 --> 00:00:56.460
Rolling rainbow star!

00:00:56.470 --> 00:00:58.830
If you go there...

00:00:58.840 --> 00:01:02.830
...you'll surely find it!

00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:06.210
Lovely roller coaster!

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:08.690
Under this sky...

00:01:08.700 --> 00:01:11.340
...its a total pleasure!

00:01:13.610 --> 00:01:16.060
Being together like this...

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.590
...is something I'll never forget!

00:01:23.280 --> 00:01:25.780
Under this sky...

00:01:25.780 --> 00:01:28.270
...we'll walk together!

00:01:26.170 --> 00:01:30.060
The Terror of the Murder Collector!!

00:01:32.510 --> 00:01:33.690
Infiltrate and investigate?

00:01:34.670 --> 00:01:37.190
Amakusa-kun and I together?

00:01:37.790 --> 00:01:39.150
Yes.

00:01:39.680 --> 00:01:41.660
First look at this.

00:01:41.380 --> 00:01:43.860
Rumors of the Collector

00:01:42.440 --> 00:01:43.210
Collector?

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:48.500
This is the website of an elite high school, Shibusawa Academy.

00:01:49.110 --> 00:01:52.590
Lately there have been strange rumors appearing on its message board.

00:01:53.150 --> 00:01:56.630
One of the students is supposedly collecting snuff videos.

00:01:57.860 --> 00:02:00.890
Umm, what's a snuff video?

00:02:01.620 --> 00:02:05.100
A video tape of an actual murder.

00:02:06.410 --> 00:02:12.980
And the person in the video is one of the school's
female students, who vanished a month ago.

00:02:13.420 --> 00:02:14.780
It's all rumor.

00:02:15.090 --> 00:02:22.660
But it is true that one of the students, Ogura Emina, has gone missing.

00:02:23.470 --> 00:02:30.580
So the school has hired us to find out the veracity and source of these rumors.

00:02:31.360 --> 00:02:32.960
This is dangerous work.

00:02:33.190 --> 00:02:35.670
It's up to you whether to take it.

00:02:36.150 --> 00:02:36.960
I'll do it.

00:02:37.860 --> 00:02:38.630
I will too.

00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:47.560
Hey, what are you doing?

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:48.770
Kyuu!

00:02:49.710 --> 00:02:54.110
Well, since only the two of them were called we kinda got worried.

00:02:54.550 --> 00:02:56.440
That's right, Dan-sensei!

00:02:56.760 --> 00:02:58.990
Why are we being left behind?

00:02:59.380 --> 00:03:00.900
He's got no choice, does he?

00:03:01.050 --> 00:03:06.790
I'm an elementary schooler, and nobody's going
to mistake you for a student at an elite school.

00:03:07.890 --> 00:03:09.080
Then I'll go!

00:03:09.560 --> 00:03:13.920
Next time if there's an elementary school we need
to infiltrate, you can come with me Kyuu.

00:03:15.730 --> 00:03:16.590
What?

00:03:16.690 --> 00:03:18.800
Everybody thinks I look like an elementary schooler?

00:03:19.320 --> 00:03:20.340
Goodbye.

00:03:21.450 --> 00:03:22.680
H-hey!

00:03:22.910 --> 00:03:24.760
Don't just say goodbye and walk off!

00:03:24.780 --> 00:03:25.800
Is this really a good idea?

00:03:27.330 --> 00:03:30.520
There's just something strange about that Amakusa kid.

00:03:31.670 --> 00:03:37.320
The event a few days ago proved that somebody has infiltrated DDS.

00:03:37.710 --> 00:03:38.530
Hongou-kun.

00:03:40.050 --> 00:03:45.530
Suspecting people without proof is just what they want us to do.

00:03:46.850 --> 00:03:48.700
Hey, Ryuu!

00:03:49.730 --> 00:03:51.160
What's wrong, Kyuu?

00:03:51.770 --> 00:03:53.710
There's something I want to ask you.

00:03:54.730 --> 00:03:57.710
When Megu and I were locked in that room a few days ago...

00:03:59.650 --> 00:04:02.260
I just can't shake the feeling that their target was Megu.

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:05.090
If they come after her again...

00:04:07.990 --> 00:04:08.850
please...

00:04:08.870 --> 00:04:10.020
protect Megu!

00:04:10.910 --> 00:04:12.560
I know I can trust you, Ryuu!

00:04:16.840 --> 00:04:19.900
I have a very high opinion of his abilities.

00:04:20.550 --> 00:04:26.740
And more than anything, he is a candidate of the
Q Class, one of whom is going to take my place.

00:04:30.100 --> 00:04:32.370
I'll protect Megu.

00:04:39.560 --> 00:04:41.530
Shibusawa Academy

00:04:41.720 --> 00:04:43.500
Special Class

00:04:43.280 --> 00:04:50.310
Everyone, let me introduce our new students. Minami Megu and Amakusa Ryuu.

00:04:56.380 --> 00:04:57.770
What?

00:04:58.000 --> 00:04:59.860
They don’t even look at us.

00:04:59.880 --> 00:05:00.820
Creepy.

00:05:01.340 --> 00:05:03.490
OK, let's start class.

00:05:07.350 --> 00:05:10.370
Do you do calculus in first year of high school?

00:05:10.850 --> 00:05:15.040
Normally you would do it in second and third year... but this an elite school.

00:05:15.560 --> 00:05:16.920
What?

00:05:16.940 --> 00:05:19.460
We're still middle schoolers!

00:05:19.480 --> 00:05:20.380
Hey, you guys.

00:05:21.280 --> 00:05:22.300
Transfer students.

00:05:22.820 --> 00:05:24.800
What are you whispering?

00:05:27.570 --> 00:05:28.390
I'm sorry.

00:05:29.530 --> 00:05:33.310
Talking on the first day of class, you must think you're pretty good.

00:05:34.540 --> 00:05:35.390
Well, teacher?

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:39.350
Why don't we have him solve that problem.

00:05:40.460 --> 00:05:42.610
It's the kind of problem that would appear on an entrance
exam for Tokyo University's Sciences Department.

00:05:43.340 --> 00:05:50.490
If you can't solve it, then we won't accept
you as a member of this special A class.

00:05:50.850 --> 00:05:52.450
No way...

00:05:58.810 --> 00:06:00.460
<i>What?</i>

00:06:01.480 --> 00:06:03.340
<i>This is bullying!</i>

00:06:05.950 --> 00:06:06.590
Sensei?

00:06:07.280 --> 00:06:09.090
Is this OK?

00:06:18.920 --> 00:06:19.940
<i>No way...</i>

00:06:20.460 --> 00:06:21.980
<i>He took less than three minutes.</i>

00:06:22.420 --> 00:06:24.730
<i>Not even the best students in the school could do that.</i>

00:06:33.720 --> 00:06:37.620
You're amazing Ryuu-kun. To be able to solve a problem like that so easily.

00:06:39.020 --> 00:06:41.080
We're transfer students.

00:06:42.070 --> 00:06:43.250
Act like it.

00:06:44.150 --> 00:06:44.800
Yeah.

00:06:44.980 --> 00:06:46.960
Amakusa-kun!

00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:49.380
Hey, what school did you come from?

00:06:49.410 --> 00:06:51.930
You were the best student at it, weren't you?

00:06:51.950 --> 00:06:53.850
What are your best subjects?

00:06:54.120 --> 00:06:55.430
Well, umm...

00:06:56.250 --> 00:06:57.520
Hey, girls.

00:06:58.210 --> 00:07:00.440
You're bothering the new student.

00:07:01.080 --> 00:07:02.520
I'm Tominaga Masashi

00:07:04.630 --> 00:07:06.980
If there's anything you need help with, let me know.

00:07:07.760 --> 00:07:08.440
Hi.

00:07:08.930 --> 00:07:11.490
Umm... who's the Female class rep?

00:07:12.390 --> 00:07:12.990
Oh...

00:07:13.430 --> 00:07:14.280
I'm sorry.

00:07:15.010 --> 00:07:17.200
I'm Touya Kuniko.

00:07:17.350 --> 00:07:19.580
Nice to meet you, Minami-san.

00:07:20.020 --> 00:07:21.790
Call me Megu.

00:07:21.810 --> 00:07:22.830
Hi.

00:07:23.690 --> 00:07:24.710
But...

00:07:25.230 --> 00:07:27.800
That won't work with her.

00:07:29.030 --> 00:07:33.010
She's not the type of person who can call her Friends
anything other than something like Minami-san.

00:07:33.990 --> 00:07:35.970
I'm Asabuki Maya.

00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:38.600
Call me, Maya, Megu.

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:45.730
By the way, Megu... what's your relationship with Amakusa?

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:49.400
Nothing really, we're just both transfer students...

00:07:49.760 --> 00:07:51.400
He's not bad is he?

00:07:51.630 --> 00:07:52.740
He's so cool!

00:07:53.340 --> 00:07:56.120
And how smart is he?

00:07:56.810 --> 00:08:01.000
That crammer Kogura's in danger, isn't he?

00:08:04.230 --> 00:08:10.880
But the worst one is Oobayashi, who's now in danger of
being kicked out of the class ‘cause Amakusa's here.

00:08:11.610 --> 00:08:13.010
He can hear you.

00:08:20.830 --> 00:08:23.230
He's kinda scary.

00:08:24.540 --> 00:08:26.480
He's a kind you don't see often at this school.

00:08:26.670 --> 00:08:27.820
That's right.

00:08:27.840 --> 00:08:34.240
When those rumors started spreading everybody
thought that he was the Collector.

00:08:34.590 --> 00:08:36.280
What? Collector?

00:08:42.640 --> 00:08:44.790
I got a mail from Kazuma a while ago.

00:08:45.730 --> 00:08:49.460
He's learned that somebody from the Special-A class is occasionally

00:08:49.940 --> 00:08:53.260
spreading rumors about the Collector on the school's homepage.

00:08:53.990 --> 00:08:57.220
Then... did he learn who?

00:08:57.870 --> 00:08:59.760
No, he couldn't find that out.

00:09:00.290 --> 00:09:07.860
But maybe those rumors were spread deliberately as
an announcement of some kind of incident to come.

00:09:08.630 --> 00:09:10.860
Announcement of an incident?

00:09:11.340 --> 00:09:13.740
What are you doing?

00:09:16.930 --> 00:09:19.660
The two transfer students are hanging out together.

00:09:19.890 --> 00:09:23.290
Improper relationships are against the rules.

00:09:26.440 --> 00:09:28.960
Hey, you're living in the dorms, right?

00:09:29.360 --> 00:09:33.920
That means that once the bullying starts, you've got nowhere to run.

00:09:36.780 --> 00:09:39.720
Your girl's pretty cute.

00:09:40.540 --> 00:09:44.890
If her picture got uploaded on to the net,
all the maniacs might fall in love with her.

00:09:50.840 --> 00:09:51.690
Ryuu-kun!

00:09:54.630 --> 00:09:55.820
Hey, you.

00:09:57.140 --> 00:10:01.120
How about I cut out your vocal cords right now?

00:10:02.680 --> 00:10:05.000
Listen, stay away From us.

00:10:05.600 --> 00:10:10.250
If you don't, I'll carve a scar into your Face that you'll never get off.

00:10:10.820 --> 00:10:13.000
I'm sorry!

00:10:16.110 --> 00:10:17.380
Thank you, Ryuu-kun.

00:10:17.780 --> 00:10:20.550
But that was a bit much...

00:10:23.370 --> 00:10:24.390
a spoon?

00:10:25.120 --> 00:10:26.850
It was laying on the ground next to him.

00:10:27.370 --> 00:10:33.480
In that situation, anybody would think a
Flat metal object like that was a knife.

00:10:35.970 --> 00:10:37.650
Now, next is the dorm.

00:10:43.180 --> 00:10:46.290
The boys and girls dorms are separate.

00:10:46.640 --> 00:10:48.790
Megu, be careful.

00:10:48.940 --> 00:10:50.250
Yeah.

00:10:53.270 --> 00:10:58.880
At that time, I felt that Ryuu with a spoon, knocking that kid onto the ground,

00:10:59.780 --> 00:11:03.550
was more threatening than somebody with a knife.

00:11:04.790 --> 00:11:07.980
Those icy eyes that he sometimes had...

00:11:08.420 --> 00:11:09.230
what were they?

00:11:19.380 --> 00:11:21.660
So you're the transfer student?

00:11:22.680 --> 00:11:25.830
I'm Sakuma, I'm a senior and the dorm-head.

00:11:27.100 --> 00:11:31.000
I hear that you did quite an impressive performance right after coming here.

00:11:32.690 --> 00:11:36.250
We've got one to a room here, and each room has a PC.

00:11:37.070 --> 00:11:40.260
Any rumors get spread really quickly by the message board, so be careful.

00:11:41.200 --> 00:11:42.220
Careful of what?

00:11:42.740 --> 00:11:45.800
Stand out too much and nothing good will happen, you know.

00:11:47.040 --> 00:11:48.680
Now then, this is your room.

00:11:52.710 --> 00:11:53.150
Huh?

00:11:53.710 --> 00:11:56.440
The PC's power's on...

00:11:59.380 --> 00:12:00.190
Collector?

00:12:03.600 --> 00:12:04.570
A snuff video.

00:12:06.640 --> 00:12:08.870
No, this is a fake.

00:12:09.390 --> 00:12:10.950
Those are bad special effects.

00:12:12.150 --> 00:12:14.460
Even so that's really creepy.

00:12:15.400 --> 00:12:17.000
I'll call a teacher.

00:12:17.150 --> 00:12:18.670
No, it's fine.

00:12:19.320 --> 00:12:22.840
It's just somebody trying to scare the transfer student.

00:12:23.320 --> 00:12:24.510
You think?

00:12:41.500 --> 00:12:44.930
Touya-san, you're the head of the women's dorm too huh?

00:12:46.330 --> 00:12:47.810
I was made to do it.

00:12:48.500 --> 00:12:50.900
I don't have any Friends so I've got plenty of free time.

00:12:52.970 --> 00:12:54.650
Kinda dark.

00:12:55.300 --> 00:12:58.530
Huh? Ogura Emina?

00:12:59.850 --> 00:13:01.370
That room's a little...

00:13:02.140 --> 00:13:02.910
What's wrong?

00:13:03.480 --> 00:13:07.040
The person who lives there has gone missing.

00:13:10.110 --> 00:13:12.590
what kind of person where they?

00:13:13.320 --> 00:13:15.220
They were wonderful!

00:13:16.860 --> 00:13:21.300
Cheerful, cute... I thought I wanted to be like her.

00:13:24.960 --> 00:13:28.480
I know I never could, though...

00:13:30.670 --> 00:13:32.070
Snuff video?

00:13:32.340 --> 00:13:36.440
Yeah, the guy's fingerprints were still on the PC.

00:13:37.050 --> 00:13:40.740
We just need to match them with the fingerprints from the desks.

00:13:45.810 --> 00:13:46.450
Here it is.

00:13:47.940 --> 00:13:50.830
The fingerprints match.

00:13:51.610 --> 00:13:52.710
This desk is...

00:13:53.360 --> 00:13:54.000
Yes.

00:13:54.740 --> 00:14:00.680
The one who put the snuff video on my PC was the Academy's best student,

00:14:00.700 --> 00:14:01.800
Kogure Junya.

00:14:06.080 --> 00:14:09.190
Damn that transfer student...

00:14:10.710 --> 00:14:12.360
I'm going to chase you out of here.

00:14:13.550 --> 00:14:15.780
Just like I did then.

00:14:18.930 --> 00:14:19.530
Yes?

00:14:22.140 --> 00:14:23.410
Oh, you?

00:14:24.180 --> 00:14:26.080
Sorry, I'm busy now.

00:14:30.310 --> 00:14:31.210
What is it?

00:14:31.230 --> 00:14:32.500
Come back tomorrow, OK?

00:14:44.540 --> 00:14:47.520
I got a note saying that Kogure-kun is out today with a cold.

00:14:48.710 --> 00:14:50.850
Tominaga-kun, do you know anything about it?

00:14:51.540 --> 00:14:53.400
No, nothing.

00:14:54.380 --> 00:14:57.400
Somebody found out it was him who did it, and he ran away?

00:14:57.970 --> 00:14:58.610
No way.

00:15:26.330 --> 00:15:29.020
If you solve for alpha, beta, and gamma...

00:15:29.790 --> 00:15:32.060
Kogure-san's not here today either.

00:15:41.510 --> 00:15:42.110
Sensei.

00:15:42.930 --> 00:15:45.370
Is Kogure-san away again today?

00:15:45.970 --> 00:15:47.030
Looks like it.

00:15:47.520 --> 00:15:49.040
Two days in a row...

00:15:50.230 --> 00:15:55.080
Sensei, can I see the note he sent?

00:15:55.690 --> 00:15:56.380
Sure.

00:15:57.530 --> 00:15:58.500
A word processor wrote that...

00:15:59.780 --> 00:16:02.510
I found it inside my grade book yesterday.

00:16:03.280 --> 00:16:05.260
Sensei, have you talked to him?

00:16:06.870 --> 00:16:10.430
I phoned his room a while ago but nobody answered.

00:16:14.500 --> 00:16:15.480
Is this really OK?

00:16:15.750 --> 00:16:17.560
He's really touchy about stuff...

00:16:17.800 --> 00:16:22.610
If you go in his room without asking just because
he's out with a cold he'll get really mad

00:16:23.010 --> 00:16:24.200
Don't you think it's strange?

00:16:24.930 --> 00:16:27.780
The note saying he was out was written on a PC.

00:16:28.560 --> 00:16:30.660
And he won't answer his phone.

00:16:31.270 --> 00:16:33.910
Something may have happened to him.

00:16:34.560 --> 00:16:36.040
No way...

00:16:45.530 --> 00:16:47.840
Kogure-kun's not here.

00:16:48.490 --> 00:16:50.720
The PC's power is still on.

00:16:56.250 --> 00:16:57.100
What is this?

00:17:03.300 --> 00:17:05.400
What's wrong, Amakusa-kun?

00:17:06.140 --> 00:17:07.030
Look at this.

00:17:11.890 --> 00:17:12.580
This is blood.

00:17:13.390 --> 00:17:14.040
What?

00:17:17.770 --> 00:17:19.830
Yeah, Ogura Emina?

00:17:20.360 --> 00:17:24.170
Yeah, she was cute and from a rich family... all the guys loved her.

00:17:24.650 --> 00:17:27.680
Then she didn't have a reason to vanish did she?

00:17:29.950 --> 00:17:31.100
Actually...

00:17:31.450 --> 00:17:34.600
don't tell anybody, but I saw something.

00:17:35.580 --> 00:17:38.230
Three days before she vanished.

00:17:46.760 --> 00:17:50.780
It felt like she was really worried about something.

00:17:51.100 --> 00:17:55.830
So I'm thinking maybe she killed herself.

00:17:55.850 --> 00:17:57.410
I think not.

00:17:58.730 --> 00:18:02.170
I think that she was murdered.

00:18:02.650 --> 00:18:04.670
You can't mean...

00:18:05.110 --> 00:18:06.720
Yeah, the Collector.

00:18:07.780 --> 00:18:09.590
You've heard about it, right Minami-san?

00:18:09.620 --> 00:18:13.510
The rumor that one of our students is collecting snuff videos.

00:18:14.950 --> 00:18:18.140
And that in his room there's a mountain of videotapes...

00:18:19.130 --> 00:18:22.270
and that somebody snuck one of them out of his room

00:18:22.300 --> 00:18:26.530
and if was of a missing student being killed.

00:18:29.640 --> 00:18:35.700
That's why the school came to DDS... that just can't be a coincidence.

00:18:36.310 --> 00:18:36.750
Huh?

00:18:37.980 --> 00:18:40.250
No, nothing, nothing.

00:18:40.810 --> 00:18:44.960
Hey, want to investigate this thing ourselves?

00:18:45.610 --> 00:18:46.630
Investigate?

00:18:48.070 --> 00:18:49.840
That'd be fun. . maybe.

00:18:50.110 --> 00:18:51.760
Yeah, I'll do it!

00:18:52.070 --> 00:18:54.640
I'll invite Amakusa-kun!

00:18:54.830 --> 00:18:57.680
Oh... ok

00:18:58.790 --> 00:19:01.390
Hey, Touya-san, want to help too?

00:19:01.920 --> 00:19:05.730
Didn't you say that Ogura-san was a person you really admired?

00:19:06.710 --> 00:19:08.490
You must be worried.

00:19:08.760 --> 00:19:10.070
That'll never happen.

00:19:10.090 --> 00:19:12.320
She's got zero enthusiasm.

00:19:13.760 --> 00:19:14.490
I'll do it.

00:19:16.470 --> 00:19:18.450
Let me join you.

00:19:19.690 --> 00:19:20.580
OK, it's decided.

00:19:26.360 --> 00:19:28.130
Ryuu-kun, where are you?

00:19:28.820 --> 00:19:29.840
My room in the dorm.

00:19:30.320 --> 00:19:32.220
I'm talking with Kazuma-kun via email.

00:19:32.820 --> 00:19:37.100
OK, so the class and I have decided to all be detectives.

00:19:37.830 --> 00:19:40.730
Of course, you're going to join us...

00:19:40.750 --> 00:19:43.850
so now the two of us don't have to sneak around together.

00:19:44.290 --> 00:19:47.360
The members are Asamuki-san, Touya-san,

00:19:47.960 --> 00:19:50.030
and Tominaga-kun...

00:19:54.390 --> 00:19:54.910
Megu.

00:19:55.180 --> 00:19:55.780
What's wrong Megu?

00:20:03.940 --> 00:20:05.080
DDS.

00:20:05.900 --> 00:20:07.090
So that's it.

00:20:07.400 --> 00:20:09.170
Megu, what's wrong Megu?

00:20:13.780 --> 00:20:15.470
Megu... no way...

00:20:16.660 --> 00:20:18.430
Please, protect Megu!

00:20:21.080 --> 00:20:21.600
<i>Megu!</i>

00:20:35.890 --> 00:20:37.870
<i>What... who is this?</i>

00:20:44.400 --> 00:20:45.250
<i>Kogure-san?</i>

00:20:48.320 --> 00:20:50.130
<i>What's that? A video camera?</i>

00:21:13.380 --> 00:21:14.990
Hey, Amakusa-kun.

00:21:15.510 --> 00:21:17.610
Hey, have you seen Minami-san?

00:21:18.510 --> 00:21:19.950
We're looking for her too.

00:21:20.640 --> 00:21:25.040
I went back to the dorm, but she wasn't there.

00:21:26.350 --> 00:21:27.250
<i>What should I...</i>

00:21:27.730 --> 00:21:29.750
<i>should I call for help from DDS?</i>

00:21:30.520 --> 00:21:34.340
<i>But what if it was them who kidnapped her?</i>

00:21:37.450 --> 00:21:42.350
Everyone, actually Minami-san might have been kidnapped by somebody.

00:21:43.700 --> 00:21:46.890
She suddenly just hung up the middle of my phone conversation with her,

00:21:46.920 --> 00:21:49.230
and now she won't pick up.

00:21:50.000 --> 00:21:53.940
This may be related to those rumors of the collector...

00:21:54.510 --> 00:21:55.610
What?

00:21:55.880 --> 00:21:58.950
When did this happen?

00:21:59.350 --> 00:22:01.070
Thirty minutes ago.

00:22:01.510 --> 00:22:04.410
Please, look for her with me.

00:22:06.350 --> 00:22:07.790
Then let's split into two.

00:22:08.310 --> 00:22:10.170
I and Amakusa-kun will check the dorm.

00:22:10.480 --> 00:22:12.540
You guys check the gym.

00:22:14.190 --> 00:22:15.170
See you later.

00:22:15.900 --> 00:22:17.130
Let's go, Amakusa-kun.

00:22:31.210 --> 00:22:31.900
Well?

00:22:32.500 --> 00:22:34.150
No luck, we can't find her.

00:22:34.920 --> 00:22:37.070
*********

00:22:37.340 --> 00:22:40.410
I thought about that and tried calling her, there...

00:22:40.890 --> 00:22:42.120
But she's not gone home.

00:22:42.810 --> 00:22:45.950
Hmm, what about the net?

00:22:46.850 --> 00:22:47.540
Net?

00:22:48.100 --> 00:22:55.500
If it's related to those rumors of the collector maybe
the school's BBS could tell us something.

00:22:58.490 --> 00:22:59.170
Well?

00:22:59.780 --> 00:23:01.220
There's a movie along with it.

00:23:03.950 --> 00:23:05.720
Snuff Theatre?

00:23:07.330 --> 00:23:08.980
Look, that's Kogure!

00:23:11.290 --> 00:23:12.440
Who the hell is that?

00:23:17.970 --> 00:23:18.690
Megu!

00:23:23.010 --> 00:23:23.570
Megu!

00:23:23.760 --> 00:23:24.660
Minami-san!

00:23:32.230 --> 00:23:32.790
Megu!

00:23:33.360 --> 00:23:34.330
Save me...

00:23:35.320 --> 00:23:36.130
Ryuu-kun!

00:23:37.400 --> 00:23:38.130
RYUU!

00:23:38.820 --> 00:23:41.090
Detective Academy Q

00:23:45.590 --> 00:23:47.420
THOSE THINGS REFLECTED IN YOUR EYES...

00:23:47.420 --> 00:23:49.760
...ARE DESTINED TO FALL APART.

00:23:49.760 --> 00:23:52.430
NO! NO! NO! NO! BELIEVING IN THAT...

00:23:52.430 --> 00:23:54.090
...IS UP TO YOU.

00:23:54.090 --> 00:23:56.100
LOVE AND KINDNESS...

00:23:56.100 --> 00:23:58.390
...OFTEN STEM FROM SELFISHNESS.

00:23:58.390 --> 00:24:00.930
IF YOU STILL PURSUE THEM...

00:24:00.930 --> 00:24:02.730
...YOU'RE JUST WANDERING AIMLESSLY.

00:24:03.440 --> 00:24:06.980
IT CAN SEEM BOTH FAR AND NEAR...

00:24:06.980 --> 00:24:10.610
THAT PLACE WHERE LOVE LIVES.

00:24:11.650 --> 00:24:13.700
THE UNSEEN STORY...

00:24:13.700 --> 00:24:16.120
...IS A MESSAGE TO YOU.

00:24:16.120 --> 00:24:18.240
YOU'RE USED TO WAITING FOR IT...

00:24:18.240 --> 00:24:19.790
...WITHOUT GIVING UP!

00:24:20.250 --> 00:24:22.460
THE UNSEEN STORY...

00:24:22.460 --> 00:24:24.670
EVEN WHEN WE'RE LOST...

00:24:25.170 --> 00:24:26.880
...CAN'T WE BELIEVE...

00:24:26.880 --> 00:24:30.380
...THAT WE CAN STILL DO IT?

00:24:31.170 --> 00:24:33.340
THE UNSEEN STORY...

00:24:33.340 --> 00:24:35.260
EVEN WHEN WERE LOST...

00:24:35.260 --> 00:24:37.640
...CAN'T WE BELIEVE...

00:24:37.680 --> 00:24:40.470
...THAT WE CAN STILL DO?

00:24:42.770 --> 00:24:46.500
What's Kinta's new job?

00:24:42.770 --> 00:24:46.500
Right after this!

00:24:47.770 --> 00:24:56.470
Next Episode

